Subject: Replace chrismellard ACR helper module path in go.mod

Origin: DHI-internal (GO-2026-6225 go.mod replace before go/bump tidy)
Description: Drop the stale chrismellard indirect require and add a replace to github.com/osscontainertools/docker-credential-acr v0.8.0 so transitive helm/registry imports resolve without listing osscontainertools as a second module path alongside the replace target.
Advisory: https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6225
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/zarf-dev/zarf a2dd0bbf96514212a6192f391d2f171ad1d88498
Regenerate: on v0.88.0 checkout, remove the chrismellard indirect require line and append `replace github.com/chrismellard/docker-credential-acr-env => github.com/osscontainertools/docker-credential-acr v0.8.0` after the modernc.org/sqlite replace in go.mod
Forwarded: not-needed (DHI packaging only; upstream still lists chrismellard indirect)
Drop-When: never: upstream v0.88.0 still vendors chrismellard until a release ships go.mod replace and drops vendor copies
Verify: sbom pkg:golang/github.com/osscontainertools/docker-credential-acr@0.8.0

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -7,6 +7,10 @@ replace github.com/xeipuuv/gojsonschema => github.com/defenseunicorns/gojsonschem
 
 // Once https://github.com/glebarez/go-sqlite updates to handle breaking changes in modernc.org/sqlite v1.33.0 this can be removed
 replace modernc.org/sqlite => modernc.org/sqlite v1.32.0
 
+replace github.com/chrismellard/docker-credential-acr-env => github.com/osscontainertools/docker-credential-acr v0.8.0
