 	github.com/charmbracelet/harmonica v0.2.0 // indirect
 	github.com/charmbracelet/lipgloss v1.1.0 // indirect
-	github.com/chrismellard/docker-credential-acr-env v0.0.0-20230304212654-82a0ddb27589 // indirect
